tive Motion in a Robotic Swarm; response Threshold Distributions to Improve Best-of-N Decisions in Minimalistic Robot Swarms; stability-Guided Particle Swarm Optimization; automatic Extraction ofÂ Understandable Controllers fromÂ Video Observations ofÂ Swarm Behaviors; benchmarking Performances ofÂ Collective Decision-Making Strategies withÂ Respect toÂ Communication Bandwidths inÂ Discrete Collective Estimation; best-of-N Collective Decisions onÂ aÂ Hierarchy.},
