  abstract = {The environmental problems faced today are essentialy human problems. In this sense, understanding the green areas as an essential element to improve the urban environment and population's health, is looked forward to show the environmental perception as a way to go on studies of the public green areas, such as plazas, parks and gardens. Hence the purpose is to know the feelings that influence the formation of value judgments and guide attitudes and actions about these spaces.},
