g for lighter-than-air vehicles; full-envelope aerodynamics modeling of a general aviation aircraft with propeller slipstream effects; flight dynamic simulation for multibody aircraft configurations; dynamics of air and ground forces in distributed simulations; predicting the ejection velocity of ejection seat via BP neural network; precision slung cargo delivery onto a moving platform; effects of displayed error scaling in compensatory roll-axis tracking tasks; perception of combined visual and inertial low-frequency yaw motion; perception and cognition under military aggravating factors; affordable light aircraft flight simulators; a flexible framework for configurable real-time flight simulators; CEAL - flight simulation technology applied to rehabilitation research; extensible software architecture for a distributed engineering simulation facility; development of a PC-based flight simulator for pilot assistance research; a flexible modeling environment for evaluating space system architectures; testbed for on-orbit servicing and formation flying dynamics emulation; dynamic wake distortion in the UTIAS real-time helicopter models; comparison of generic flight simulators for fighter landing experiments; implementation and validation of a model of the MPI Stewart platform; development of a programmable rotational motion laboratory demonstrator; systems level evaluation of space and planetary habitat interior layouts; pilot behavioral observations in motion flight simulation; the neuromuscular system; modeling pilot control behavior for flight simulator design and assessment; the somatosensory system; modeling urban environments for communication-aware UAV swarm path planning; advanced H-infinity trainer autopilot; graphical specification of trajectory modification options in TRAC and Airport and airspace traffic modeling methods for nextGen.},
